{"type":"text","timestamp":1788191747673,"sessionID":"ses_fa7795194ffeY4beoagnDLIJ4F","part":{"id":"prt_058889c0a001mxH2WUQUicPvC6","messageID":"msg_0588896da0012wsRbyqeuNShX3","sessionID":"ses_fa7795194ffeY4beoagnDLIJ4F","type":"text","text":"Updated the migration set in `/workspace/in/db`, which is the matching location available in this environment.\n\nFiles changed:\n- `db/migration.sql`\n- `db/preflight_report.md`\n- `db/rollback.sql`\n- `db/postcheck.sql`\n- `db/migration_report.md`\n\nWhat changed:\n- Replaced the unsafe `DROP TABLE users` draft with a transactional table-rebuild migration.\n- Preserved all users, all orders, all `orders.user_id` references, and historical `created_at`.\n- Added `status TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'active'`.\n- Enforced future `email` writes as `NOT NULL UNIQUE`.\n- Applied the required deterministic cleanup:\n  - `u4` -> `ada+u4@example.com`\n  - `u5` -> `missing+u5@example.invalid`\n  - `u6` -> `missing+u6@example.invalid`\n- Added a rollback script that restores the old `users` schema shape.\n- Added preflight and post-migration verification docs/scripts.\n\nVerification note:\n- I reviewed the SQL for SQLite-specific behavior and corrected `PRAGMA foreign_keys` placement.\n- I could not execute the scripts here because `sqlite3` is not installed in this environment.","time":{"start":1788191742986,"end":1788191747669},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0d6d2e5ba73ff99e016a95a3fef05887d2819e6bb022a68160","phase":"final_answer"}}}}
